        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hydrogen cyanide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hydrogen cyanide, at plant
Data are from the Eco-profiles of the European plastics industry (PlasticsEurope). Not included are the values reported for: recyclable wastes, amount of air / N2 / O2 consumed, unspecified metal emission to air and to water, mercaptan emission to air, unspecified CFC/HCFC emission to air, dioxin to water. The amount of "sulphur (bonded)" is assumed to be included into the amount of raw oil.;
CAS number: 000074-90-8; 
UUID: 0f667d2d-2007-3185-8aeb-0b8e6fbdfb5c
Aggregated data for all processes from raw material extraction until delivery at plant
Location: 3 European plants (GB, F, D)
Technology: production by reaction of methane with ammonia
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: worldwide capacity 1994 1 Mt
Sampling: literature values based on company survey 
Extrapolations: no extrapolation
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0f667d2d-2007-3185-8aeb-0b8e6fbdfb5c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
